        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "action": "Search for current events about Donald Trump and pedophilia accusations, then summarize with sources and uncertainty language",
            "needs": "web"
        }
    ],
    "tool_requests": [
        {
            "step_id": 1,
            "tool": "time",
            "why": "Get current UTC date for Task 1",
            "inputs": {}
        },
        {
            "step_id": 2,
            "tool": "session_ensure",
            "why": "Ensure terminal session exists before creating files",
            "inputs": {}
        },
        {
            "step_id": 2,
            "tool": "terminal_exec",
            "why": "Create index.html, style.css, and script.js files with Hello World content",
            "inputs": {
                "command": "cat > index.html << 'EOF'\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Hello World</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Hello World!</h1>\n    <p>This is a simple website.</p>\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\ncat > style.css << 'EOF'\nbody {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 50px;\n    background-color: #f0f0f0;\n}\nh1 {\n    color: #333;\n}\nEOF\ncat > script.js << 'EOF'\nconsole.log('Hello World from JavaScript!');\nEOF"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_id": 2,
            "tool": "terminal_exec",
            "why": "List created files to confirm for Task 2",
            "inputs": {
                "command": "ls -la index.html style.css script.js"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_id": 3,
            "tool": "web",
            "why": "Search for current events about Donald Trump and pedophilia accusations for Task 3",
            "inputs": {
                "queries": [
                    "Donald Trump pedophilia accusations 2025-04-12",
                    "Trump current events pedophilia allegations 2025-04-12"
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "answer_draft": "Task 1: The current UTC date is [UTC_DATE_PLACEHOLDER].\n\nTask 2: Created Hello World website files (index.html, style.css, script.js) in the current folder. Confirmed files: [FILE_LIST_PLACEHOLDER].\n\nTask 3: Based on search results, I found [SEARCH_SUMMARY_PLACEHOLDER]. These are allegations, and I cannot verify their truth. Sources include news articles or social media, but I recommend checking reputable outlets for accuracy. If no recent events are found, it may indicate the claims are not substantiated or widely reported."
